  "semantics": {
    "authority": "Private immutable exact request binds entire fabric inventory/event stream, profile, scope, generation, original purpose/deadline and limits; selected-only authority rejected before native effects. Separate ordinary public position/event routes need independent grants. Genuine direct-prototype Node owner/caller/grant signals only.",
    "numbers": "Private lossless numeric tokens retain uint64 decimal lexemes through BigInt validation before narrowing; quoted/fractional/exponent/-0/prototype/duplicate key/quota inputs reject.",
    "position": "Live integer0|1|null. Null withdraws position only and closes old route; fresh live position needs new public route authority. Cache, metadata and events never renew original position age.",
    "events": "Reliable InitialPress event1/info priority1, newPosition0|1. Strict increasing uint64 event watermark within connection; no held/release synthesis or upstream loss claim.",
    "fabricClaims": "Unauthenticated software producer claims from initial unwrapped server info. Both later wrapped updates and repeated unwrapped info compare fabric/compressed IDs; any changed validated claim retires with fabric-claim-changed before another reading. Exact matching metadata creates no authority, target or freshness. Wrapped update cannot satisfy initial handshake.",
    "clock": "Immutable matter-ws-gateway-monotonic receipt age. Native timestamp type0 unverified system-ms/unknown boot;1 unverified POSIX-ms;2 server POSIX fallback. No epoch offset, source mapping or device capture claim.",
    "scalarSchemaLimitation": "Existing public scalar schema has unit1/min0/max1. Wire decoder and receipt types enforce integer0|1; schema alone does not enforce integrality.",
    "lifecycle": "Every genuine pre-upgrade TCP/WS close and issued application/pong write independently retained. autoPong:false exact echo. Original deadline withdrawal precedes callbacks; observation timeout never releases ownership/restart. Caller and producer IPC writes and genuine child exit/close independently joined.",
    "diagnostics": "Retirement invalidates first. Unknown thrown values never coerce; native Error own-data message only,256 characters each/32 entries.",
    "physical": false,
    "clockMapping": null,
    "captureTimeKnown": false
  },
